BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:byron-12swcn1@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T160000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T200000
SUMMARY:SUB-TRIBE
DESCRIPTION:SUB-TRIBE LIVE AT HOTEL BRUNSWICK SUNDAY 13 SEPTEMBER | FROM 4P
 M | FREE EVENT From the roots of Aotearoa (New Zealand) comes SUB-TRIBE 
 — a 7-piece dub-fusion powerhouse delivering heavy bass\, glitchy beats 
 and soaring harmonies. Blending blues-soaked dub\, chunky skank reggae\, j
 azz-hop and ragga dancehall\, SUB-TRIBE take audiences on a genre-hopping 
 journey that keeps dancefloors moving and heads nodding. Known for their h
 igh-energy live shows and feel-good vibes\, SUB-TRIBE have carved out a so
 und often described as “Unprecedented Dub-Fusion.” Since forming in 20
 17 and touring alongside Salmonella Dub\, the band has built a strong repu
 tation across Australia and New Zealand\, appearing at major festivals inc
 luding WOMADelaide\, Good Love Festival\, Kuranda Roots and Island Vibes. 
 With releases spanning deep\, rolling dub\, soulful lovers rock and bass-d
 riven dancefloor anthems\, SUB-TRIBE bring a live show that’s equal part
 s groove\, grit and celebration. w/ support | Free Entry Come skank\, sway
  and get deep in the low end.
LOCATION:Hotel Brunswick
URL:https://hotelbrunswick.com.au/event/sub-tribe-3/
END:VEVENT
