DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260918T210000
SUMMARY:The Star Court Theatre Games Show
DESCRIPTION:Star Court Theatre's very own free monthly improv event\, 2 pre
 -selected teams\, 3 judges\, 1 timekeeper\, 1 fabulous host & a faerie! If
  you're in the audience you're safe\, the teams are already chosen! Sit ba
 ck and enjoy the show!
