BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:byron-1iu3f9y@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260920
SUMMARY:Nourishing Yin Yoga and Sound Healing
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in a morning of deep relaxation and rejuvenati
 on at the Nimbin Bush Theatre with Nourishing Yin Yoga with Chrissy follow
 ed by a transformative Crystal Bowl Sound Bath with Karolynka. Let Chrissy
  guide you through gentle yin yoga postures designed to restore balance\, 
 release tension\, and nourish your body and soul while being enveloped by 
 the ethereal sounds of Armandine's crystal bowls\, creating vibrational ha
 rmony that soothes the mind and spirit. Set against the serene backdrop of
  the Nimbin Bush Theatre\, this unique experience is the perfect way to un
 wind\, reconnect\, and recharge. Don't miss this magical journey of sound 
 and stillness!
LOCATION:Nimbin Bush Theatre\, 2 Blue Knob Road Nimbin NSW 2480
URL:https://nimbinbushtheatre.com/events/nourishing-yin-yoga-and-sound-heal
 ing/
END:VEVENT
